<title>USA: Lernout names Gaston Bastiaens president.</title>
<headline>Lernout names Gaston Bastiaens president.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lernout &amp; Hauspie Speech Products NV said on Tuesday that it named Gaston Bastiaens as president.</p>
<p>The company said it appointed Bob Kutnick as chief technology officer and senior vice president of mergers and acquisitions.  </p>
<p>Gaston Bastiaens replaces Yacov Levy, who resigned but will continue to provide consulting support to the company.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
